{"id":"14eb54ea7202ac54","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/052_替换_Frege_证明系统.md","title":"052 替换 Frege 证明系统","display":"052_替换_Frege_证明系统","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-公式与模式\">1. 公式与模式</h1>\n<p>命题变元集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。模式变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{MVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>模式公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{MVar}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{MVar}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\">\\(P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>与</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mvar},\\operatorname{pneg},\\operatorname{pimp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mvar},\\operatorname{pneg},\\operatorname{pimp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{SF}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-两类替换\">2. 两类替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\sigma\">\\(A\\sigma\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\sigma=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\sigma=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\sigma=\\operatorname{neg}(A\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\sigma=\\operatorname{imp}(A\\sigma,B\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\sigma=\\operatorname{neg}(A\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\sigma=\\operatorname{imp}(A\\sigma,B\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模式替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_{SF}:\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\times\\{\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inst}_{SF}:\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}\\times\\{\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下，只用于生成公理模式实例和规则模式实例：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\theta=\\theta(X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\theta=\\theta(X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\theta=\\operatorname{neg}(P\\theta),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\theta=\\operatorname{imp}(P\\theta,Q\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\theta=\\operatorname{neg}(P\\theta),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\theta=\\operatorname{imp}(P\\theta,Q\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{SF}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{SF}\\)</span> 为公式相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公理与规则\">3. 公理与规则</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BasePat}_{SF}\">\\(\\mathsf{BasePat}_{SF}\\)</span> 为下列三个模式公式组成的集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z)))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z)))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)),\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)),\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\\)</span> 是这些模式的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>-实例：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\n=\n\\{P\\theta:P\\in\\mathsf{BasePat}_{SF},\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\n=\n\\{P\\theta:P\\in\\mathsf{BasePat}_{SF},\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分离规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{SF}\n=\n\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{SF}\n=\n\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF}\n=\n\\{((A),A\\sigma):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF},\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF}\n=\n\\{((A),A\\sigma):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF},\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SF}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{SF}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{SF}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{SF}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-证明\">4. 证明</h1>\n<p>替换 Frege 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 满足下列一种条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\">\\(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=B\">\\(p(k)=B\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>、公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=A\\sigma\">\\(p(k)=A\\sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{SF}(p,k)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\np(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i,j&lt;k\\ \\exists A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\n\\bigl(p(i)=A\\wedge p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\wedge p(k)=B\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i&lt;k\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\n\\bigl(p(i)=A\\wedge p(k)=A\\sigma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{SF}(p,k)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\np(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i,j&lt;k\\ \\exists A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\n\\bigl(p(i)=A\\wedge p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\wedge p(k)=B\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists i&lt;k\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\n\\bigl(p(i)=A\\wedge p(k)=A\\sigma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\wedge\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{SF}(p,k)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\wedge\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{SF}(p,k)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{SF}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{SF}(p,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{SF}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{SF}(p,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_{SF}(p,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(n&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\wedge p(n-1)=A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Last}_{SF}(p,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(n&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\wedge p(n-1)=A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-大小\">5. 大小</h1>\n<p>公式大小函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|_{SF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\cdot|_{SF}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造子定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{atom}(p)|_{SF}=1,\n\\qquad\n|\\operatorname{neg}(A)|_{SF}=1+|A|_{SF},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{atom}(p)|_{SF}=1,\n\\qquad\n|\\operatorname{neg}(A)|_{SF}=1+|A|_{SF},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)|_{SF}=1+|A|_{SF}+|B|_{SF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)|_{SF}=1+|A|_{SF}+|B|_{SF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换规则行的大小为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"1+|A|_{SF}+|A\\sigma|_{SF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[1+|A|_{SF}+|A\\sigma|_{SF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明大小为所有行大小之和，替换行使用上式，其他行使用公式大小。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-行许可谓词\">6. 行许可谓词</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AxLine}_{SF}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{AxLine}_{SF}(B)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MPLine}_{SF}(p,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{MPLine}_{SF}(p,k)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=B\">\\(p(k)=B\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubLine}_{SF}(p,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubLine}_{SF}(p,k)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=A\\sigma\">\\(p(k)=A\\sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-主判断\">7. 主判断</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{SF}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{SF}(p,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{SF}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{SF}(p,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后承闭包为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{SF}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}:\\vdash_{SF}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{SF}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}:\\vdash_{SF}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{SF}\n=\n(\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF},\n\\operatorname{SubLine}_{SF},\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF},\\vdash_{SF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{SF}\n=\n(\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF},\n\\operatorname{SubLine}_{SF},\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF},\\vdash_{SF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换既是逐构造子定义的公式操作，也是只作用于先前定理行的显式一前提规则。证明不开放假设，因此替换行不会把固定假设集合中的公式错误地替换为新假设。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>替换规则关系细化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF}(A,\\sigma)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF},\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF}(A,\\sigma)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF},\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{SF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换 Frege 的行许可谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{SF}(p,k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{SF}(p,k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价于第 4 节给出的三项析取条件。证明对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ProofSeq}_{SF}\n=\n\\{p:\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ProofSeq}_{SF}\n=\n\\{p:\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF}(p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SubstitutionFrege}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF},\n\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{SF},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{SF},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{SF},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{SF},\n\n\\operatorname{AxLine}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{MPLine}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{SubLine}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF},\n\\mathsf{ProofSeq}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{SF},\n|\\cdot|_{SF},\n\\vdash_{SF},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{SF},\n\\Delta_{SF}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SubstitutionFrege}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF},\n\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{SF},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{SF},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SF},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{SF},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}^{SF},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{SF},\n\n\\operatorname{AxLine}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{MPLine}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{SubLine}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{SF},\n\\mathsf{ProofSeq}_{SF},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{SF},\n|\\cdot|_{SF},\n\\vdash_{SF},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{SF},\n\\Delta_{SF}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只比 Frege 增加显式命题替换推理规则；不含扩展定义变量、电路语义或语义有效性判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-公式与模式","text":"1. 公式与模式","level":1},{"id":"2.-两类替换","text":"2. 两类替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理与规则","text":"3. 公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"4.-证明","text":"4. 证明","level":1},{"id":"5.-大小","text":"5. 大小","level":1},{"id":"6.-行许可谓词","text":"6. 行许可谓词","level":1},{"id":"7.-主判断","text":"7. 主判断","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{MVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathsf{MVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\